    "founder-block": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "founder-heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "From The Founder",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "founder-body": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We started Real Skin Care because our family wanted products where we could confirm every ingredient. With lip balm, that meant flipping over the tube and asking why petrolatum, paraffin, and undisclosed flavoring were in something we put on our kids' lips every day.<\/p><p>We took it down to three ingredients that each do real work, and we won't compromise that for cost.<\/p><p>— Sean Fillmore<\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        }
      },
